# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with LF, so clang-format, Node and the gates see the same bytes on
# every machine. PowerShell scripts and the installer script keep CRLF for Windows' own tools.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
*.rc text eol=crlf

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
